{
 "encounter_id": "00973",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning. I've got my phone with the photos, if that helps. I'd like a proper review of my skincare regime, because the scarring is bothering me more than the new breakouts."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please show me. While I look, tell me what you're using at the moment."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Adapalene gel, once a day, at night. Benzoyl peroxide gel, in the morning. Lymecycline, 408 mg, once a day. Azelaic acid cream, twice a day. And a moisturiser, CeraVe, twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's a thorough routine. Are you finding the combination irritating?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No peeling, no stinging, which surprised me. The dryness is fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what's changed recently?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "New spots, on the jawline. About three weeks of them, mostly before my period."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Trimethoprim. My lips swelled up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. Tell me about your skin history."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Acne since I was fourteen. Polycystic ovaries, diagnosed at twenty. And eczema as a child."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a pharmacist, so I'm quite fussy about my regime."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And diet, anything you've cut out?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dairy free, for two years. It helped a little, I think."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take two numbers while we talk. Blood pressure 112 over 70, pulse 66.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's normal for me. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now, the photographs. Let me swipe through. You're quite right that the scarring is the main thing. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mostly on the cheeks. Some of them are quite deep. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Scarring is hard to treat, and the most important thing is to stop new scars forming. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's why I'm doing all of this. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long have you been on the lymecycline? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Five months. I know it's meant to be limited. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exactly. Antibiotics for acne are usually kept to three to six months, to avoid resistance. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I wondered if I should come off it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I think you've done the right thing by asking. Let's talk about what comes next. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is there an alternative? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There are options, including hormonal treatments that suit people with polycystic ovaries, and a stronger oral treatment. We'd discuss each carefully. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hormonal, perhaps. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's not decide today. For now, stay on everything you're doing, and don't stop the antibiotic suddenly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take photos in the same light every two weeks, so we can see whether the scars are improving."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll do that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Use a high-factor sunscreen daily. Sun darkens scars."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Always. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in eight weeks, with the photos."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Eight weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
